  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: 2nd number × ((2nd number × (2nd number + 1)) + 1) = 1st number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 399 : 7\n\n⇒ 7 × ((7 × (__**7 + 1**__)) + 1)\n\n⇒ 7 × ((__**7 × 8**__) + 1)\n\n⇒ 7 × (__**56**____** + 1**__)\n\n⇒ __**7 × 57**__ = 399\n\nFor, 584 : 8\n\n⇒ 8 × ((8 × (__**8** + 1__)) + 1)\n\n⇒ 8 × ((__8 × 9__) + 1)\n\n⇒ 7 × (__72____ + 1__)\n\n⇒ __8 × 73__ = 584\n\nSimilarly, for ? : 11\n\n⇒ 11 × ((11 × (__11 + 1__)) + 1)\n\n⇒ 11 × ((__11 × 12__) + 1)\n\n⇒ 11 × (__132____ + 1__)\n\n⇒ __11 × 133__ = 1463",
